    "description": "Swiftlet public function."
  },
  "Swiftlet — sw_status": {
    "prefix": "blyx-swiftlet-sw_status",
    "body": "sw_status(${1:found}, ${2:mask}, ${3:method})$0",
    "description": "Build a method set and apply the same status decisions as the router. Start at zero."
  },
  "Swiftlet — sw_enable": {
